     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br>I&#39;m trying to run irace with a dummy example using both a runner and evaluator but I&#39;m facing an assertion error :<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># 2017-04-21 11:58:47 CEST: End of iteration 2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> traceback</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iraceResults$experimentLog</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> experimentsUsedSoFar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scenario </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scenario</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> parameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">main</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scenario</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cmdline</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iraceResults$experimentLog</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> experimentsUsedSoFar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iraceResults$experimentLog</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> experimentsUsedSoFar </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">An</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unexpected condition occurred</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Please</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> report </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bug to t