\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ras</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">acs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">└&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># cat scenario.txt </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameterFile </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./parameters.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>execDir </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;.&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>trainInstancesDir </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./Instances&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>maxExperiments </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>targetEvaluator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;./target-evaluator&quot;</span></div></code></div><br><br><br>What am I doing wrong?<br><br><br></div>"
