   "subject": "Re: [irace-package] Evaluator gives me Error in irace.assert(sum(nrow(iraceResults$experimentLog)) == experimentsUsedSoFar)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Dear Zimmer,\r<br>\r<br>Thanks for reporting this. Please see the recent thread started by Johannes \r<br>Maschler.\r<br>\r<br>In a nutshell, the assert is detecting that experimentLog is not updated \r<br>correctly. This is just a log that can be used for further analysis, if you \r<br>don&#39;t use it there is no bug. You may either comment out the assert, downgrade \r<br>to irace 2.1 (but experimentLog may be also wrong there) or wait a few days \r<br>until we release a version fixed in CRAN.\r<br>\r<br>Cheers,\r<br>\r<br>Manuel.\r<br>\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
  },
